import numpy as np

DESCRIPTION = ("The network is a 2-layer attention-only transformer whose decision is the argmax of position 5's residual "
               "times W_U, and that argmax is always one of classes 0..3 (classes 4 and 5 are never chosen anywhere), so only "
               "the three class differences W_U[:,1:4]-W_U[:,0:1] matter. Pick the residual basis M = [pinv(W_pos)|null(W_pos)]: "
               "then W_pos M is the literal one-hot of the position in the first six coordinates and zero in the last two, so the "
               "embedding stage is exactly (one-hot code of the token at position p) + (one-hot of p), with no constants at all. "
               "In that basis every subsequent step is a fixed table: h = tok + pos, layer-0 attention pattern "
               "a0 = softmax(h A0 h^T) (scale 1/sqrt(8) folded into A0), layer-0 attention output d0 = sum_k a0[q,k] h_k VO0, "
               "residual r0 = h + d0, layer-1 attention pattern a1 = softmax(r0 A1 r0^T), and finally "
               "scores[1:4] = r0[5] G + sum_k a1[5,k] (r0_k H), scores[0] = 0, because only query position 5 feeds the readout "
               "and only the 3 class-difference directions are needed. A0, A1, VO0 are full rank 8 and cannot be factored more "
               "cheaply, so the whole network is 48+64+64+64+24+24 = 288 measured numbers plus a 0/1 position table (656 "
               "parameters, 327 effective degrees of freedom after the head/residual-basis symmetries).")

